This project is built on, and holds (engine/) and its installer bundles the source code of, nfshp2-port-win by ZloiKILLER
(https://github.com/ZloiKILLER/nfshp2-port-win): the static recompiler of the game and the PS2 runtime. Its files keep their
authorship; how engine/ was made from it is in docs/upstream-patches/, later changes are in this repository's history. Anyone
reusing this project's code: keep this credit, and the link to ZloiKILLER's project, with it.

Files from nfshp2-web by Vitorini (engine/src/mac/web/) are under the MIT License (LICENSES/MIT-nfshp2-web.txt). The installer's
scripts adapt NFSU2Deadware's by LeoDeadware (MIT, LICENSES/MIT-NFSU2Deadware.txt). The settings overlay follows the NFS
Underground ports' and SpeedBreaker's design; Dear ImGui (MIT), Roboto (Apache-2.0), SMAA (MIT) and the libraries:
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

No game code or data is part of this project or its releases: the game is built on the player's Mac from their own disc.
